      "writtenOn": "2019-01-31T10:06:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But... does this mean I can\u0027t use private DNS if I need to call bindProcessToNetwork ?\n\nSuppose (let me come up with some example) I\u0027m a random app who wants to stream some video data from the mobile network using FFMpeg (which lets me stream from a URL), because the video data is only available through the carrier\u0027s network. The user has set a strict private DNS, but their setting is then ignored.\n\nAre we fine with that ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3977,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 3977,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "65ceeb4db23ddacd2cbd4ebacb3e66b00af956dd",
